1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,050
The little prince landed on Earth.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,544
He came to a big garden.

3
00:00:05,544 --> 00:00:09,382
And in that garden, roses bloomed everywhere.

4
00:00:09,382 --> 00:00:14,102
One thousand, two thousand... five thousand roses!

5
00:00:14,102 --> 00:00:16,999
The little prince couldn't believe it.

6
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:21,014
I thought my rose was the only one in the universe.

7
00:00:21,014 --> 00:00:25,191
But she has five thousand sisters, all the same.

8
00:00:25,191 --> 00:00:29,308
The little prince sat on the grass, feeling sad.

9
00:00:29,308 --> 00:00:32,985
His rose had told him she was one of a kind.

10
00:00:32,985 --> 00:00:36,749
But here, every rose said the same thing.

11
00:00:36,749 --> 00:00:41,014
My rose is just an ordinary flower, he thought.

12
00:00:41,014 --> 00:00:44,014
Just then, a fox appeared.

13
00:00:44,014 --> 00:00:49,514
Look, said the fox, those five thousand roses do look the same.

14
00:00:49,514 --> 00:00:52,102
But your rose is different.

15
00:00:52,102 --> 00:00:54,191
You watered her.

16
00:00:54,191 --> 00:00:57,102
You protected her from the wind.

17
00:00:57,102 --> 00:01:00,617
You listened to her complaints and her pride.

18
00:01:00,617 --> 00:01:04,102
You put a glass cover over her at night.

19
00:01:04,102 --> 00:01:08,338
It's the time you spent with her that makes her so important.

20
00:01:08,338 --> 00:01:11,926
You become responsible for what you've tamed.

21
00:01:11,926 --> 00:01:14,499
The little prince looked up.

22
00:01:14,499 --> 00:01:19,941
Yes, he said, my rose is more important than all of you together.

23
00:01:19,941 --> 00:01:22,779
Because she is MY rose.

